  "body": "https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-destination shows the CSP directive for a specific destination. I think that list needs to be updated to Content Security Policy Level 3. For example the destination `\"script\"` should now be `\"script-src-elem\"`. (ref https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#effective-directive-for-a-request)",
